&lt;p style="margin-left: 60px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -12px"&gt;ｃ．特定投資株式及びみなし保有株式の銘柄ごとの株式数、貸借対照表計上額等に関する情報&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 60px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 12px"&gt;特定投資株式&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 60px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 12px"&gt;（前事業年度）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 72px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 12px"&gt;該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 72px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 12px"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
